      <guid>http://localhost:1313/about/</guid>
      <description>Martin is a photographer based in Glasgow, Scotland. His work blends a documentary approach with a personal, intimate perspective. Martin has shot editorial and commercial projects for Man About Town, Gay Times, Tommy Hilfiger, Wonderland, and Net-a-Porter.&#xA;His practice has taken him to cities including New York, London, and Paris, though his focus remains rooted in capturing authentic, human moments. He is available for commissions and collaborations via martin@martindbarker.com.</description>
